(Section 1: Passwords) Tj T*
(Passwords for company accounts must be at least 14 characters long.) Tj T*
(Passwords must be changed every 180 days.) Tj T*
(The last 10 passwords of an account cannot be reused.) Tj T*
(Passwords must never be shared, including with the IT helpdesk.) Tj T*
