(Section 2: Multi-Factor Authentication and VPN) Tj T*
(Multi-factor authentication is required for every company system.) Tj T*
(System administrators must use a hardware security key as their second factor.) Tj T*
(VPN sessions disconnect automatically after 8 hours.) Tj T*
(Connecting to the VPN from a personal device is not permitted.) Tj T*
ET
