(Section 3: Data Retention) Tj T*
(Customer records are retained for 7 years after the end of the customer contract.) Tj T*
(Application logs are retained for 400 days.) Tj T*
(Backups of deleted data are permanently purged within 35 days.) Tj T*
(Retention periods may only be changed by the Data Protection Officer.) Tj T*
ET
