(Section 4: Incident Reporting) Tj T*
(Security incidents must be reported within 1 hour of discovery.) Tj T*
(Incidents are reported to the Security Operations Center at extension 4400.) Tj T*
(Employees must not attempt to investigate an incident on their own.) Tj T*
(A written incident summary is due within 3 working days.) Tj T*
